r issues in downloaded PDFs", "created_at": "2022-09-23T03:13:04Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6c4393b4d018561478c5bf541992869755dbcb03", "message": "download.py: Rename variables", "created_at": "2022-09-23T03:04:43Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bb9ff2093faea6546898c3eae9c260cd37e37895", "message": "download.py: Download PDFs directly from BookRoll\n\nThis results in higher-quality PDFs than those merged from downloaded\nJPGs.\n\nDeprecate _download_content_images.", "created_at": "2022-09-23T02:55:11Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b19adea75759373d084115433599b216685ace75", "message": "download.py: Refactor getting content ids as a separate method\n\nAfter successfully logging in, the program now immediately fetches the\nlist of content <a> tags, instead of after _download_slides has been\ninvoked.\n\nAttributes regarding contest_list were added as well.", "created_at": "2022-09-23T02:42:36Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "873964e3333f27b02d885071d4e2035b4174bc37", "message": "download.py: Generalize content download implementation\n\nNow _download_content downloads images of a content based on its\nid(hash). The regex responsible for matching content ids has been\nmoved to method download_slides.\n\nAlso add comments and type annotations.", "created_at": "2022-09-19T13:00:55Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0fd9a7fc1e9dfb63f173a9afd5d7dd0734691998", "message": "download.py: Implement method _send_form for sending forms\n\nAlso declare rti_redirect_url as a class variable.", "created_at": "2022-09-19T12:48:13Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e65513cdf4ede170709f59584909e0a4b77830d", "message": "download.py: Allow parameters to be entered via CLI arguments\n\nDestination folder of downloads and BookRoll login credentials\ncan now be entered via CLI arguments.", "created_at": "2022-09-19T10:29:57Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "59e93c932e9396e976dc01e3bbefe0903714cebe", "message": "download.py: Split save_images into two internal methods\n\nNow method _download_images retrieves an image from url and\nsaves it to a file, and _download_chapter downloads all images\nof a chapter.\n\nAlso improve type annotation and method parameter naming.", "created_at": "2022-09-18T11:45:28Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cbd8df823d8dc9ecb3519bff1ffb908e0386ceb4", "message": "download.py: Wrap downloader into class BookRollDownloader\n\nThis makes it easier for a session to be used across all methods.", "created_at": "2022-09-18T11:04:53Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6704aa3c9a9fb43b00279de9eed882fcd33631b0", "message": "README.md: Replace semester with year\n\nThese slides are meant to be used throughout the whole year.", "created_at": "2022-09-17T11:36:07Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1fd7ae6a3293fd3309dc2d1ec1b483f3cbc5c237", "message": "README.md: Finish README.md", "created_at": "2022-09-17T03:39:19Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8cc9779bfc046a99c778a6cd82af41a2327fe508", "message": "download.py: Use getpass to get user password inputs\n\n- With minor prompt rewords and style changes", "created_at": "2022-09-17T01:26:30Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "831f993de0d4136239f041c23fa05fc3cc46b566", "message": "Add script to merge all .jpg files in a folder to one .pdf file\n\n- Add chapters.json for mapping chapter numbers to chapter titles\n- Update requirements.txt", "created_at": "2022-09-16T12:31:45Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5348242d5d3e94d97e99417570c0715c9872fdcb", "message": "Rename main.py to download.py and add line breaks\n\nLine breaks are added to follow the line length limits in the\nGoogle style guide.", "created_at": "2022-09-16T09:44:53Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d09d8d85e1112adf18ca5c41e92c52c1a9326e9b", "message": "Add script to download BookRoll images", "created_at": "2022-09-15T14:03:04Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bd618d2950175bc2469713d30842082e933a2d89", "message": "Add repository and project settings", "created_at": "2022-10-04T11:38:58Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95e8deddd8483fc8861555a062d3338096c04677", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2022-09-15T13:50:35Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-BookRoll", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dbb697dc23f6d22ef0c1ce06d39af4a7ba372d80", "message": "Tidy action workflow files", "created_at": "2023-03-24T03:00:01Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-website-mirror", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff5022ce34b1743043936110bb2a31225a4c5f54", "message": "Revert \"Replace personal access token with `GITHUB_TOKEN`\"\n\nWe still need to push changes using a personal access token, so that\nthe \"Deploy to Pages\" workflow will be triggered.\nRefer to https://docs.github.com/en/actions/using-workflows/triggering-a-workflow#triggering-a-workflow-from-a-workflow.\n\nThis reverts commit e19d02ef33ecae80a4321631f7cab8043ca59b61.", "created_at": "2023-03-23T07:31:22Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-website-mirror", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e19d02ef33ecae80a4321631f7cab8043ca59b61", "message": "Replace personal access token with `GITHUB_TOKEN`\n\nWith correct permissions set, the automatically created `GITHUB_TOKEN` secret\r\nis sufficient, and the personal access token is no longer needed.", "created_at": "2023-03-23T06:39:45Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-website-mirror", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d22308a793a8b433d55859335051483ada652884", "message": "clone.yml: Allow auto commit of PNG files", "created_at": "2023-02-13T11:12:21Z", "repo": "NCU-calculus-website-mirror", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2023-05-27T15:57:30Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2023-04-03T12:16:57Z", "body_length": 0}]}